#     occurrence instead, which is loaded into the jsonb column at upgrade.
#     "Analytics" is both, so it carries both kinds.
#   * the filename is `vi.po` because `get_po_paths()` only ever opens
#     `i18n/vi.po` and `i18n/vi_VN.po`.
